<%# A page below the Chat-Personas tab (doc/verwaltung_seitennavigation_plan.md §5, S3):
    the head of the AI section with its tabs, Chat-Personas marked as the parent, then
    the crumb back to the list. No padding above the head: the title stands where every
    page puts it. Head, crumb and form in one block: the layout's content column puts a
    gap between its children. The form keeps its width and has no top margin: the crumb
    holds the distance below the tab row. %>
<div>
  <%= render 'organisations/shared/settings_subnav', active: :ai,
                                                     tabs: ai_section_tabs(@current_organisation), tab_active: :personas,
                                                     below_tab: true %>
  <%= render 'organisations/shared/section_crumb', back_label: t('views.organisations.ai_overview.pages.personas'),
                                                   back_path: organisation_prompt_personas_path(@current_organisation),
                                                   page: t('views.organisations.prompt_personas.new.title') %>

  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto">
    <%= render 'form', prompt_persona: @prompt_persona %>
  </div>
</div>
